  "body": "Permanent. Group limit 1 in play. Purchase only at deck creation.\nWhen an investigator performs a 【Fight】 action against an enemy engaged with another investigator, that skill test gets +1 difficulty. If the attack fails, the engaged investigator may test 🦶 (X), where X is the amount the attack failed by. If they succeed, the engaged investigator takes no damage from the failed attack.",
